      "resource_type": "story",
      "text": "Wave 3 consumer follow-up to original finding1220961226475447: exact current9f Any057bf2f0, Heartbf60e841, sharedplannere0add036 and Any metadata sources are retained. A narrow isolated caller correction is being prepared for exact UTF-8 selection/replay/text/style-key/name readback; original journals, prepared source keys/status-before-commit, ACK order and uncertain outcomes remain unchanged. No native/Engine or global AnyJSON edit, runtime or repeated network proof.\n\nOne source-locator request for Wave1: please provide the existing immutable native PREPARED inline-file and full-file implementation/contract paths that determine persisted FileInfo name and MIME, plus any already-retained exact source receipt. The original Swift intents bind supplied name/MIME in spec bytes, but we will not infer ordinary streaming-upload normalization or omission semantics for these PREPARED routes. Existing strict name/MIME behavior stays until the exact prepared implementation is joined. No new build/test or host read is requested.",
